10 REM SID DEMO 3: THE FILTER. A SAWTOOTH CHORD THROUGH A SWEEPING LOW-PASS, RESONANCE UP.
20 S=54272
25 FOR I=0 TO 24: POKE S+I,0: NEXT: REM EVERY REGISTER CLEARED FIRST
30 PRINT CHR$(12);"SID DEMO 3: FILTER SWEEP": PRINT "ANY KEY STOPS"
40 POKE S+0,1845 AND 255: POKE S+1,INT(1845/256): REM VOICE 1: A2
50 POKE S+7,2319 AND 255: POKE S+8,INT(2319/256): REM VOICE 2: C#3
60 POKE S+14,2764 AND 255: POKE S+15,INT(2764/256): REM VOICE 3: E3
70 FOR V=0 TO 14 STEP 7: POKE S+5+V,16*1+0: POKE S+6+V,15*16+8: NEXT: REM SLOW ATTACK, FULL SUSTAIN
80 POKE S+23,15*16+7: REM RESONANCE 15, VOICES 1-3 THROUGH THE FILTER
90 POKE S+24,16+15: REM LOW-PASS, VOLUME 15
100 FOR V=0 TO 14 STEP 7: POKE S+4+V,33: NEXT: REM SAWTOOTH, GATE ON
110 FOR R=1 TO 200
120 FOR C=0 TO 255 STEP 4: POKE S+22,C: GOSUB 9000: IF PEEK(53505)>127 THEN 200
125 NEXT
130 FOR C=255 TO 0 STEP -4: POKE S+22,C: GOSUB 9000: IF PEEK(53505)>127 THEN 200
135 NEXT
140 NEXT
200 GET K$: FOR V=0 TO 14 STEP 7: POKE S+4+V,32: NEXT: GOSUB 9000: GOSUB 9000: GOSUB 9000
210 FOR V=0 TO 14 STEP 7: POKE S+4+V,0: NEXT: POKE S+24,0: POKE S+23,0: REM LEAVE THE FILTER ROUTING CLEAR FOR THE NEXT PROGRAM
990 IF PEEK(1039) THEN LOAD "DEMOS.BAS"
995 END
9000 T=PEEK(54541)
9020 IF PEEK(54541)=T THEN 9020
9030 RETURN
